<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 223 AND 151-8 V WEST INDIES (189) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 223 AND 151-8 V WEST INDIES (189) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 151 for eight in their second innings at the close on the second day of the first test against West Indies on Saturday.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka 223 and 151-8; West Indies 189.</p>
</text>
